WEBVTT

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:08.650
Take this!

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:11.830
He's so loud!

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:13.660
Want to bring him to the john?

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:18.580
Yeah, we can't let anyone see us.

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:25.640
It hurts again... My head...

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:27.250
Why?

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:29.350
Is it because I saw the red thing?

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:31.850
Red... No...

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:33.800
No...

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.390
It hurts...

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:37.220
I'm scared...

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:38.610
No...

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:41.600
Someone, help me!

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:50.860
It's the person from before...

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:53.710
Is she... my family?

00:00:53.710 --> 00:00:57.160
Someone I care about who's always with me...

00:00:57.460 --> 00:01:01.200
Hey... Are you going to help me?

00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:05.540
Shio, I thought I told you...

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:09.380
not to let go of Mommy's hand.

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.800
But you let go of Mommy's hand.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:19.210
Mom?

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:21.240
You know, Shio...

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:23.370
I'll never ever...

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:25.560
forgive you.

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:08.750
Shio!

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:11.670
Where are you, Shio?

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:15.020
Shio!

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:19.760
-What was that for, all of a sudden?
-What?

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:22.930
Isn't she the girl from
the missing-person flyer?

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:25.990
She's alive. I'm amazed.

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:28.270
Doesn't that make us amazing for finding her?

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:32.080
Think we'd get a reward or something
if we told the cops?

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:34.150
Man, I doubt it.

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:37.660
Hey, I have a plan.

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:41.670
That dirty guy with the hood
was looking for her, right?

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:44.030
Let's call him over and beat his ass.

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:46.170
I'm still pissed off.

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:47.490
Good call.

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:48.540
Hey.

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:52.540
Rise and shine, girlie.

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:57.210
Hey, boys!

00:03:57.640 --> 00:04:01.130
If you're not busy, I could sure use some playmates.

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:06.110
Yeah. Sure.

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:07.640
Doesn't she look dangerous?

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:10.160
No. She's a good catch.

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:12.060
I can smell it from here.

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:16.060
You never change,
you womanizer.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:20.820
Now then, sweetheart...

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:23.540
Don't tell me, you're a runaway?

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:26.880
Is it because of your parents?
I know how you feel.

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:30.700
Always saying, "It's for your own good."
"It's because I love you."

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:33.850
Grownups think they know it all.
It drives me crazy.

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:36.360
You can come crash at my place.

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:40.160
No one's going to tell you what to do there.

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:43.360
And if you treat me right while you're there,

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:45.360
I'll even give you money.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:46.510
You want money...

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:49.310
right?

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:51.160
Hey.

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:53.980
Do you have anything you care about
more than money?

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:02.780
I do.

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:06.700
Something tells me you wouldn't get it, though.

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:10.950
Hey, you!
I'll freaking kill you!

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:14.080
Dumbass!
You think you can beat me unarmed?

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:17.520
You bit--

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:28.510
I learned it the hard way.

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:30.690
When the person you care about is gone,

00:05:30.690 --> 00:05:33.910
the world looks monochrome.

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:36.280
But...

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:38.900
that night is over now.

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:42.570
Let's all go home, okay?

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:48.320
Wait... What are you--?

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:50.300
Stop!

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:08.430
Shio-chan...

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:34.370
So warm...

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:37.800
So soft. It feels good...

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:40.260
It's really warm...

00:06:40.260 --> 00:06:43.810
I love this feeling.

00:06:43.810 --> 00:06:45.890
But then why...

00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:48.760
did everything go black
all of a sudden?

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:01.750
Shio-chan...

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:05.410
It smells like Satou-chan...

00:07:05.410 --> 00:07:07.000
The real...

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:09.530
Satou-chan...

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:11.240
Satou-chan!

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:14.760
Satou-chan! Satou-chan! I'm sorry!

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:16.880
I was scared being alone.

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:20.120
I broke our promise.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:23.220
I went outside to look for you,

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:26.300
but then I got confused.

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:29.270
And then... And then...

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:33.730
Shio-chan, listen.

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:37.820
I'd never leave you and go somewhere else.

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:42.020
That's why this castle exists.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:48.830
A castle for you and me
to live in together happily, forever.

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:52.360
As long as we're here,
there's nothing to be afraid of.

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:55.130
I might be late sometimes,

00:07:55.130 --> 00:07:57.630
but I'll always come back here.

00:07:57.630 --> 00:08:00.150
So it'll be okay.

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:03.670
You don't have to think about anything.

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:06.350
I'll protect you.

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:08.110
Okay...

00:08:11.230 --> 00:08:13.520
Shio-chan, don't cry.

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:16.610
You didn't do anything wrong.

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:32.420
Right. This was all my fault.

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:37.970
I shouldn't have believed what Shio-chan said.

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:41.290
When it comes to Shio-chan, I can't help it.

00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:50.800
Love really is strange.

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:55.190
Love... Love...

00:08:55.190 --> 00:09:00.810
Love...

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:11.080
Auntie, you're hurt again.

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:15.570
I'm okay. After all...

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:18.490
This is also love.

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:28.460
But I won't screw up anymore.

00:09:29.930 --> 00:09:33.150
I'll never make the same mistake again.

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:34.550
No matter what.

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.690
Satou-chan, good morning.

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:56.540
Shio-chan, good morning.

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:58.610
Today we're having...

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:02.870
fried eggs for breakfast.
Your favorite!

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:06.790
I put tofu and aburaage in the miso soup.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.960
What do you think?

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:11.730
I'm so happy!

00:10:11.730 --> 00:10:15.940
Your fried eggs are so soft and delicious!

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:17.560
Thank goodness.

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:19.890
She's the same Shio-chan as always.

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:22.180
-Thanks for the meal!
-Thanks for the meal!

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:26.350
Delicious!

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:29.120
It's sweet when Shio-chan smiles.

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:31.500
But it's also a little...

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:34.070
Hey, Shio-chan.

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:37.110
Last night, did you talk to anyone...

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:39.820
other than me?

00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:44.370
I didn't.

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:46.200
I see.

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.790
It's soft...

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:52.460
There's something just a bit off.

00:10:55.630 --> 00:11:01.440
Maybe something scary happened
when she went outside.

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:05.560
It might not be good to dig into things right now.

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:08.180
I did take care of that.

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:11.690
But I'm sure someone must have seen us.

00:11:12.910 --> 00:11:15.980
Satou-chan, are you going to be late today too?

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:19.900
I was just lucky yesterday.

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:23.460
Shio-chan, sorry.

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:25.700
I'll come home as soon as I can.

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:28.050
Then let's spend lots of time talking.

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:29.970
Let's take a bath together,

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:33.380
eat dinner, and keep each other company.

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:35.040
Yeah!

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:36.480
I'm going now.

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:38.980
Be careful.

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:56.040
Welcome back,

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:59.210
my happy sugar life.

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:19.550
Good, good. I got paid.

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:21.690
I've saved up a lot.

00:12:21.690 --> 00:12:23.900
Cooking at home really does work.

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:25.850
Satou!

00:12:25.850 --> 00:12:27.510
Hey!

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:28.900
Good morning!

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:32.160
How are things between you and Kitaumekawa recently?

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:33.940
Mr. Kitaumekawa?

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:36.040
You guys talk alone sometimes.

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:37.610
How suspicious.

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:39.460
I've told you before.

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:44.500
Mr. Kitaumekawa is just worried about me
because I don't have parents.

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:45.570
It's not like that.

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:48.420
Impressive, Kitaumekawa.
What a nice guy.

00:12:48.420 --> 00:12:50.300
I should go after him.

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:53.050
I don't recommend that.

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:55.580
There you go again.

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:58.960
If that's what you say...

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:01.440
Take this! Tickle, tickle!

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:05.270
-No! Stop!
-You live alone with your aunt, right?

00:13:05.270 --> 00:13:06.530
Yeah.

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:08.320
I've never seen her before.

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:10.410
What is she like? Is she pretty?

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:16.150
She never says a word
about anything I do.

00:13:16.150 --> 00:13:19.540
What? That's great, right?

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:21.840
Well, I guess.

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:44.100
I'm not at home right now.

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:46.760
Please leave a message at the--

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:49.730
She didn't answer today either.

00:13:49.730 --> 00:13:52.680
I've been calling every day.

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:56.870
I got rid of that trash
she gave me the other day.

00:13:56.870 --> 00:14:00.110
I didn't ask what was inside,
and I didn't check.

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:03.670
None of the teachers, including myself,

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:07.630
have ever met her aunt
or heard her voice before.

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:11.530
Is she just refusing to meet us? Or...

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:20.720
But could that really happen?

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:23.380
No. That girl's not normal.

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:27.470
That look in her eyes when she scolded me...

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:33.720
I'll never forget
that thrilling feeling she gave me.

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:37.140
How could I ever forget?

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:50.450
More.

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:53.470
Insult me more. Step on me.

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:56.370
Give me more pleasure.

00:14:57.590 --> 00:14:59.370
I made it in time.

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:02.430
Satou, they're going to close early today.

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:04.000
Why?

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:08.980
I heard there was a violent crime near here last night.

00:15:08.980 --> 00:15:10.720
The victim...

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:14.220
had both eyes gouged out.

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:16.280
According to the rumors!

00:15:16.280 --> 00:15:17.680
Really?

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:22.290
That's why they're telling us
to go straight home after work today.

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:23.450
I see.

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:25.790
Maybe I'll clean the house today.

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:27.690
Really? That's your priority?

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:32.460
You know...

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:35.740
I saw some guys fighting last night too.

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:39.960
Men can be so scary sometimes.

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:44.750
Satou, marry me!

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:47.140
Hey, you guys.

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:49.600
Chatting and you're late for work?

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:52.930
You guys know it's payday today, right?

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:55.990
Mitori! We're not late yet!

00:15:55.990 --> 00:15:57.310
We're safe!

00:15:58.030 --> 00:16:01.280
I wish you'd get ready for work earlier
than your seniors.

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:03.190
Am I wrong?

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:07.610
Sorry. We'll work extra hard, though.

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:11.000
Matsuzaka, you're working quite a few shifts.

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:12.280
Are you okay?

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:16.510
I mean, it's not like you have money problems, right?

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:19.200
Mitori,

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:21.620
I have a dream.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:25.310
And it happens to require lots of money.

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:29.050
That's why I want to keep giving it my all.

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:30.810
A dream?

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:33.020
That's wonderful, Satou.

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:35.970
Yeah. It's good to have dreams.

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:38.070
All right, let's get to work!

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:39.890
Yeah!

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:43.410
-Oh, by the way, Matsuzaka...
-Yes?

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:46.790
-A package we sent to you was returned.
-Let's do this!

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:51.880
We tried sending it a few times,
but no one accepted it.

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:53.290
Did anyone tell you?

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:54.790
No.

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:57.740
I'll take it home today myself.

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:59.670
Sorry to cause trouble.

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:03.130
No, it's no problem.

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:05.670
By the way, where's Mitsuboshi today?

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:08.350
He's taking time off.

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:11.090
We're short staffed, but let's work hard.

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:13.070
Yes.

00:17:15.070 --> 00:17:16.430
Taiyo?

00:17:17.650 --> 00:17:20.850
Taiyo? How do you feel?

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:23.430
Are you okay?

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:25.730
Yeah. I'm okay!

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:27.990
Oh, good.

00:17:27.990 --> 00:17:30.420
Rest well.

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:45.710
Shio-chan...

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:48.670
She was really cute.

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:52.600
Small... Warm...

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:54.730
and soft...

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:56.900
My...

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:59.600
My angel.

00:18:00.190 --> 00:18:02.990
But Shio-chan is a missing person.

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:05.520
Her family must be looking for her.

00:18:06.490 --> 00:18:09.270
Despite that, Matsuzaka...

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:11.980
What in the world are you up to?

00:18:27.300 --> 00:18:29.790
Are you talking about your family?

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:31.270
Family?

00:18:31.270 --> 00:18:33.060
They're looking for you.

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:36.260
Your mom and your dad.

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:47.980
Spinning...

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:52.400
Spinning... Spinning... Spinning...

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:55.420
Shio-chan, I'm back!

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:04.260
Welcome home, Satou-chan!

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.560
That tickles.

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:14.850
What?

00:19:14.850 --> 00:19:16.510
It's nothing.

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:18.480
Tell me what you said.

00:19:18.480 --> 00:19:20.770
I said you're really good at this.

00:19:20.770 --> 00:19:22.430
Really?

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:24.490
All right, let's switch.

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:26.990
You be on this side.

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:30.100
I'll wash you next.

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:32.060
You can't, Satou-chan!

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:33.730
Why?

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:39.900
Your breasts would get squished by my head
and that's not good.

00:19:42.380 --> 00:19:45.050
My breasts will go back to normal. It's okay.

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:47.300
Really?

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:54.180
Shio-chan.

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:58.150
Satou-chan, you're so heavy!

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:00.680
Done!

00:20:01.270 --> 00:20:03.340
Wow, hamburger steak!

00:20:05.110 --> 00:20:06.650
Delicious.

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:08.770
Make sure you chew your food.

00:20:09.780 --> 00:20:12.400
Here, Satou-chan! Say "Ah"!

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:19.170
Delightful!

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:21.150
You're a cutie!

00:20:27.340 --> 00:20:29.250
There we go.

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:32.140
Shio-chan?

00:20:40.520 --> 00:20:42.720
Good night, Shio-chan.

00:20:55.990 --> 00:20:59.500
Oh, we didn't say our vows tonight.

00:20:59.500 --> 00:20:59.820
Too bad.
Oh, we didn't say our vows tonight.

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:01.370
Too bad.

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:04.510
Shio-chan is already asleep.

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:13.050
I've got to ask her to say them for me tomorrow.

00:21:13.050 --> 00:21:16.960
Without it, I feel so weak.

00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:24.180
This blood

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:26.530
really won't come off.

00:21:27.850 --> 00:21:31.490
Oh, well. We're not using this room anyway.

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:34.240
That's enough for today.

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:42.370
Account Balance

00:21:42.370 --> 00:21:44.150
I have to work harder.

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:46.840
I have to build a wonderful castle

00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:50.130
where I can be with Shio-chan forever.

00:24:08.060 --> 00:24:10.470
Satou.

00:24:13.360 --> 00:24:17.900
Those who violate love must pay the price.

